#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:5 e09676b1fee34a3b856cdc9e338afa6a
msgid "Arming Plane"
msgstr "解锁 Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:7 564ba9e17c1a4152a29740ce267e57cb
msgid ""
"Before you can fly your plane you need to arm it. Arming the aircraft before"
" flight has two purposes:"
msgstr "飞行前需要解锁飞机。起飞前解锁飞行器有两个目的："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:10 8735a2d3f2dd4a60892a23702d5eb67d
msgid ""
"prevent the motor from turning when the pilot is not ready to fly (a safety "
"feature)"
msgstr "防止在飞手未准备好飞行时电机转动（安全功能）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:12 c1cbd917da86476ab053b92d06256a28
msgid ""
"prevent takeoff before the autopilot is fully configured and ready to fly"
msgstr "防止在飞控未完全配置并准备好飞行前起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:15 11b8ac42e8c240628bb392ac6a651317
msgid ""
"The key thing that arming does is to enable the motor. You will not be able "
"to start the motor (ie. control the throttle) until the aircraft is armed."
msgstr "解锁的关键作用是启用电机。在飞行器解锁之前，您将无法启动电机（即控制油门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:19 bed72ef9b2b94daa9ad8d9d2e713a382
msgid ""
"**Note**: If you have :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` set to 2 or 3 (you"
" are using one of the EKFs) then it is particularly important that you have "
"arming checks enabled for INS. Flying EKF without arming checks may cause a "
"crash."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：如果将 :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设为 2 或 3（使用 EKF），则对 INS "
"启用解锁检查尤为重要。在没有解锁检查的情况下飞行 EKF 可能导致坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:24 384861f7774942fb90976a40c3debd7d
msgid ""
"This feature in no way removes the need to respect the prop! When the plane "
"is powered, ALWAYS avoid placing hands in the vicinity of the propeller, "
"even when the throttle is disarmed. If all is not well with the autopilot "
"electronics or software there is always a slight possibility that signal "
"could unintentionally reach the motor. Even though this is unlikely (and "
"made even less likely by safety features such as this) it only takes one "
"time to chew up a finger or hand!"
msgstr ""
"此功能绝不能消除对螺旋桨的敬畏！飞机通电时，请始终避免将手靠近螺旋桨附近，即使油门已上锁。如果飞控电子或软件出现问题，信号可能意外传递到电机。尽管这种情况极少发生（此类安全功能使其更加不可能），但只需一次就可能造成手指或手部受伤！"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:34 ed8801a02e264cde963b138c8dd1bc19
msgid "Configuring Arming"
msgstr "配置解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:36 cda339d6a64e4c1fa9cb0b9f12b0fd17
msgid "There are three parameters which control how arming works:"
msgstr "控制解锁方式的参数有三个："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:38 c578ae5805ea4bb395c2dca8f0d04795
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`: this controls whether an arming step "
"is required. The default is 1, meaning that arming is required before "
"takeoff. If set to 0 then arming is not required (the plane starts off "
"armed)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`：控制是否需要解锁步骤。默认值为 1，表示起飞前需要解锁。若设为 "
"0，则不需要解锁（飞机起始即为已解锁状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:42 26e9ff13fd3c4e62afc105a90e3e91c0
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>`: this controls what checks the autopilot "
"does before arming is allowed. The default is 1, meaning all checks are "
"done. Most users should leave it at 1, as the arming checks are important to"
" ensure the autopilot is ready. See below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>`：控制飞控在允许解锁前执行的检查项目。默认值为 "
"1，表示执行所有检查。大多数用户应保持为 1，因为解锁检查对确保飞控已准备就绪非常重要。详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:46 b9580bcb8d6745df9d38ee25619ffc88
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`: This parameter allows you to configure "
"rudder based arming/disarming. The default is 1, meaning you are able to arm"
" with right rudder. If you set this to 2 you can also disarm with left "
"rudder. If you set this to 0 then you will only be able to arm/disarm via a "
"ground station or RC channel input using its RCx_OPTION."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`：此参数允许配置基于方向舵的解锁/上锁操作。默认值为 "
"1，表示可以使用右方向舵解锁。若设为 2，还可以使用左方向舵上锁。若设为 0，则只能通过地面站或使用 RCx_OPTION 的 RC "
"通道输入进行解锁/上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:52 4065241dc25c4d30b742bb887bb0b68d
msgid ""
"if :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` is set to 2, then held left rudder "
"can disarm the vehicle in ANY mode, if the autopilot judges that the vehicle"
" is not flying. This flying check CAN be incorrect under certain extreme "
"circumstances, and disarming of the vehicle while still in flight, while "
"rare, could occur."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` 设为 "
"2，则在任何模式下，如果飞控判断飞行器未在飞行，持续左方向舵可以上锁飞行器。此飞行状态判断在某些极端情况下可能不准确，飞行中意外上锁虽然罕见但可能发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:55 0da7eaf264374736bee1d70daa2cdbe2
msgid "Arming Checks"
msgstr "解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:57 860b5089524843ddb05d7ba33f0ac67f
msgid ""
"Before allowing arming the autopilot checks a set of conditions. All "
"conditions must pass for arming to be allowed. If any condition fails then a"
" message explaining what failed is set to the GCS. Any or all of the Pre-"
"Arming Checks can be disabled, but it is not recommended. See the "
":ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks` topic for more information."
msgstr ""
"允许解锁前，飞控会检查一组条件。所有条件必须全部通过才能解锁。若任何条件不满足，将向 GCS "
"发送说明失败原因的消息。任何或所有预解锁检查均可禁用，但不建议这样做。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks` 主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:63 09553f787ada4559a99658a40538aa36
msgid "IMPORTANT: RC Transmitter Calibration"
msgstr "重要：RC 遥控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:65 6586667060f346ff9cbf1f05ce79ee8d
msgid ""
"It is essential that your RC radio transmitter be calibrated correctly "
"before continuing. Please see the :ref:`Calibrate your RC input <common-"
"radio-control-calibration>` wiki page if you don't know how to calibrate "
"your radio."
msgstr ""
"继续之前，RC 无线电遥控器必须正确校准。如果不知道如何校准遥控器，请参阅 :ref:`校准 RC 输入 <common-radio-control-"
"calibration>` Wiki 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:68 814a6dd2a32b45b6b4c7c964fc12ecbb
msgid ""
"When calibrating your RC input you should also be careful to set the minimum"
" value of the throttle (usually RC3_MIN) to the minimum value when in normal"
" flight control. Don't set it to the value used by your transmitter when in "
"throttle failsafe or you won't be able to arm using the rudder as the "
"autopilot will think you are at a non-zero throttle level."
msgstr ""
"校准 RC 输入时，还应注意将油门最小值（通常为 "
"RC3_MIN）设置为正常飞行控制时的最小值。不要将其设置为遥控器在油门失控保护时使用的值，否则飞控会认为您的油门不在零位，导致无法用方向舵解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:75 f02507e92e6943c9bd9bcfbe68e6b0d7
msgid "How to Arm"
msgstr "如何解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:77 68d313620de74fc89632e79112be27b9
msgid ""
"When you are ready to fly you can ask Plane to arm. This can be done in "
"three ways:"
msgstr "准备好飞行时，可以要求 Plane 解锁。有三种方式："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:80 0d6b9965c8d541a1b6dacf5babb91c86
msgid ""
"**Rudder Arming**. Hold the rudder stick fully to the right and the throttle"
" stick fully down for 3 seconds."
msgstr "**方向舵解锁**。将方向舵摇杆完全向右拨并将油门摇杆完全向下保持 3 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:83 fa26d346cdbe41b097d543692778cf09
msgid ""
"when rudder arming in QuadPlanes with an autotakeoff, the motors will spin "
"at :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` and not takeoff until the rudder stick "
"is returned to neutral. Similarly, for normal plane MODE TAKEOFF, or "
"NAV_TAKEOFFs, the arming will not actually occur until the rudder stick is "
"returned to neutral to prevent the takeoff starting with full right rudder."
msgstr ""
"在 QuadPlane 中进行方向舵解锁并启用自动起飞时，电机将以 :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` "
"转速旋转，直到方向舵摇杆回到中立位置才会起飞。同样，对于普通固定翼 MODE TAKEOFF 或 "
"NAV_TAKEOFF，解锁实际上不会发生，直到方向舵摇杆回到中立位置，以防止在满右方向舵时开始起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:85 db46452664b44978b6d0e15b0143963f
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the **RC_xOPTION switches** that includes that "
"function. See switch option \"153\", \"154, or \"160\"."
msgstr "如已设置，可使用包含该功能的 **RC_xOPTION 开关**。请参阅开关选项「153」、「154」或「160」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:86 c6a4436ab2624990921c204e7b24665f
msgid "**GCS Arming**. Press the arming button on your ground station"
msgstr "**GCS 解锁**。在地面站按下解锁按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:91 0bc5d8258a154f87a10c429f91fb8a0d
msgid ""
"Location of the Arm/Disarm button in Mission Planner (button circled in red "
"near the bottom of the image)."
msgstr "Mission Planner 中解锁/上锁按钮的位置（图像底部附近红圈标注的按钮）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:93 de0311361e86480791e4a346ffc1b07c
msgid ""
"Plane does not allow arming in RTL, QRTL, or QLAND modes. Arming in other "
"throttle controlled modes, like LOITER,CRUISE,etc. is possible, but only if "
"actually flying (ie after an accidental inflight disarm, watchdog reset, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Plane 不允许在 RTL、QRTL 或 QLAND 模式下解锁。在 LOITER、CRUISE "
"等其他油门控制模式下解锁是可能的，但仅在实际飞行时（即意外飞行中上锁、看门狗复位等之后）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:96 5412f31d82434d0dbece9e3adc08a726
msgid "How to Disarm"
msgstr "如何上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:98 620d66093f3d4fbe815a60e7874b49ce
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the ``RC_xOPTION`` switches that includes that "
"function. See switch option \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "如已设置，可使用包含该功能的 ``RC_xOPTION`` 开关。请参阅开关选项「81」、「153」或「154」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:100
#: a493c32a60d5445698b2212a391007e5
msgid ""
"This is **UNCONDITIONAL**. If done while in flight, all motors disarm and "
"you must have throttle at idle before re-arming can occur!"
msgstr "这是 **无条件的**。若在飞行中执行，所有电机将上锁，必须将油门置于怠速后才能重新解锁！"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:102
#: 5bb69918d6a64280b637c2f96ab665d0
msgid ""
"It is also possible to disarm using the transmitter. This is done holding "
"throttle at minimum and rudder to the left for 2 seconds. In ArduPlane this "
"condition could be accidentally triggered by pilots while flying so there "
"are additional requirements prior to disarm:"
msgstr ""
"也可以使用遥控器上锁。方法是将油门保持在最低位置并将方向舵拨向左侧保持 2 秒。在 ArduPlane "
"中，此操作在飞行中可能被飞手意外触发，因此上锁前还有额外要求："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:107
#: a8ca3a450a9840b482a59f60288d7f4b
msgid ""
"You need to allow rudder disarming by changing **ARMING_RUDDER** parameter "
"to 2 (ArmOrDisarm) or use the ARM/DISARM switch function provided by setting"
" an RC channel's RCx_OPTION to 153."
msgstr ""
"需要将 **ARMING_RUDDER** 参数更改为 2（ArmOrDisarm）以允许方向舵上锁，或使用将 RC 通道的 RCx_OPTION 设为"
" 153 提供的 ARM/DISARM 开关功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:110
#: 1d13815fe2ad4ce8a31e6d9e7e5501ed
msgid ""
"The autopilot needs to make sure that you are not actually flying. There is "
"an algorithm for this that uses the **airspeed sensor** readings. So you "
"need this source available and giving values lower enough (in a windy day "
"you might not be able to disarm even landed if the plane thinks you are "
"still flying)"
msgstr ""
"飞控需要确认您实际上没有在飞行。有一套利用 **空速传感器** "
"读数的算法来判断。因此您需要此数据源可用且值足够低（在大风天，即使已降落，如果飞机认为您仍在飞行，也可能无法上锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:116
#: 0bfb3b83b4fd46ad939b43234fa71416
msgid ""
"You can also disarm without using the transmitter with one of the following "
"methods:"
msgstr "也可以不通过遥控器进行上锁，方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:119
#: 70613cad3bc74c0a9e21c110fc545655
msgid "use a ground station to issue a disarm command"
msgstr "使用地面站发送上锁命令"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:120
#: 4d830ce20ed24c01bf9c906f5d1a2f16
msgid ""
"use the safety switch on your aircraft (if using a :ref:`common-safety-"
"switch-pixhawk`)"
msgstr "使用飞机上的安全开关（如使用 :ref:`common-safety-switch-pixhawk`）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:121
#: 7254851f3e644e91ae514a927aeb6929
msgid ""
"after an auto-landing (either via mission or QLAND in QuadPlane) the plane "
"will automatically disarm after 20 seconds if still on the ground "
"(controlled by :ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY<LAND_DISARMDELAY>` parameter)"
msgstr ""
"自动降落后（通过任务或 QuadPlane 中的 QLAND），飞机在着陆后 20 秒将自动上锁（由 "
":ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY<LAND_DISARMDELAY>` 参数控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:126
#: e6d24ec90c21403fbb4523799adb1825
msgid "Visual and Audible signals"
msgstr "视觉和听觉信号"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:128
#: 9713f8dbd17b43309b30aa88364f7df9
msgid ""
"ArduPlane will provide visual and audio clues to the arming state if your "
"autopilot has notification LEDs and a buzzer. The clues are:"
msgstr "若飞控具有通知 LED 和蜂鸣器，ArduPlane 将通过视觉和音频提示指示解锁状态。提示如下："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:131
#: a33746e40f1549f1a801f57e8955c9dc
msgid ""
"if the autopilot is disarmed, but is ready to arm then the large 3-colour "
"LED will be flashing green"
msgstr "若飞控已上锁但准备好解锁，大型三色 LED 将闪烁绿色"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:133
#: 4d3419e1f53f4603a3d8b5237d03de5a
msgid ""
"if the autopilot is armed and ready to fly the large 3-colour LED is solid "
"green"
msgstr "若飞控已解锁且准备好飞行，大型三色 LED 将常亮绿色"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:135
#: 74e09c9e7ff34beeadad8c6d993f8886
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is ready to arm it will play a \"ready to arm\" sound on "
"the buzzer"
msgstr "当飞控准备好解锁时，蜂鸣器会播放「准备解锁」的声音"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:137
#: 3e406f21948e444583f04c89654897e7
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is armed or disarmed it will play the corresponding sound"
msgstr "当飞控解锁或上锁时，将播放相应的音效"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:140
#: 2fb3f9813208452a9dce4c5e24f9921e
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`sounds page <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` to listen to what the "
"buzzer sounds like for each state."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`音效页面 <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 聆听每种状态对应的蜂鸣器音效。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:143
#: 7294c3eaf9b447bcb1b1a74b3cd7a3f7
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 1 is set, text messages"
" will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 1 位，否则解锁或上锁时将向 GCS 发送文字消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:146
#: fdcab3661b78467aaf786a752fba429f
msgid "Throttle output when disarmed"
msgstr "上锁时的油门输出"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:148
#: 045ff0429eda4f34b30bb4e5b1ee7e2d
msgid ""
"When the plane is disarmed the throttle channel will not respond to pilot "
"input. There are two possible behaviors you can configure:"
msgstr "飞机上锁时，油门通道不响应飞手输入。可配置两种行为："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:151
#: a197ded71ee54d5f80953c5e4e3c0579
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 1. When disarmed the minimum value "
"for the throttle channel (normally RC3_MIN) will be sent to the throttle "
"channel"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 1。上锁时，油门通道（通常为 RC3_MIN）的最小值将发送到油门通道"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:153
#: 6cbbed87e0174f7f9de2c259602a3a76
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 2. When disarmed no pulses are sent "
"to the throttle channel. Note that some ESCs will beep to complain that they"
" are powered on without a control signal or even refuse to initialize and "
"operate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 2。上锁时不向油门通道发送脉冲。注意，某些 ESC "
"会发出蜂鸣声抱怨通电后没有控制信号，甚至拒绝初始化和运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:158
#: d3ec922aadf041359619c678058f0e67
msgid "Diagnosing failure to arm"
msgstr "诊断无法解锁的故障"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:160
#: 08161a7f1f1c4b9ebecaa4fdb23d50a0
msgid ""
"It can be frustrating if your plane refuses to arm. To diagnose arming "
"issues follow this guide"
msgstr "如果飞机拒绝解锁，可能令人沮丧。请按以下指南诊断解锁问题"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:164
#: 6ce6c317bce84b85b1e535302d763f76
msgid "In Landing Sequence Pre-Arm Failure"
msgstr "在降落序列中预解锁失败"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:166
#: 2bee5f1fe47b41829f9923e1737d7f42
msgid ""
"If the last mission item was a landing sequence or land command, then arming"
" is prevented and a \"Prearm: In Landing Sequence\" message is presented. "
"This can occur after an autoland, or if the autopilot is booted before RC is"
" established and the failsafe mode uses a landing sequence (ie :ref:`common-"
"do-land-start` and :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` is set, QLAND, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"如果最后一个任务项是降落序列或降落命令，则解锁将被阻止，并显示「Prearm: In Landing "
"Sequence」消息。这可能发生在自动降落后，或在 RC 未建立时飞控启动而失控保护模式使用降落序列（即 :ref:`common-do-land-"
"start` 且 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 已设置、QLAND 等）时。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:168
#: c01c6a39d0df4aa282db763c576d8b78
msgid ""
"This may be cleared by restarting the mission using the GCS or :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions` switch, or rebooting with RC active."
msgstr ""
"可通过使用 GCS 或 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` 开关重启任务，或在 RC 激活的情况下重新启动来清除此状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:171
#: b74d9d67676d4164b16ef88e196d8c3b
msgid "Check that it is ready to arm"
msgstr "检查是否准备好解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:173
#: 84be8b9105744d6d8611184a1496e0fe
msgid ""
"If your board has a \"ready to arm\" LED (the large LED in the middle of the"
" board on a Pixhawk, for example) then that LED should be flashing green "
"when the board is ready to arm. If it is flashing yellow then that indicates"
" that one of the arming checks is not passing."
msgstr ""
"如果主板有「准备解锁」LED（例如 Pixhawk 主板中间的大 LED），则主板准备好解锁时该 LED "
"应闪烁绿色。如果闪烁黄色，则表示某项解锁检查未通过。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:179
#: 9e81e90c045b41d990f2ca90c1d23415
msgid "Try arming"
msgstr "尝试解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:181
#: 0899747a0337462bbce035ec0d902ffb
msgid ""
"Try sending an arm command with your GCS. If arming is refused then a "
"message will be sent from the autopilot to the GCS indicating why it is "
"refusing to arm."
msgstr "尝试通过 GCS 发送解锁命令。若解锁被拒绝，飞控将向 GCS 发送消息说明拒绝原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:186
#: be3e1563e01e41319d5edde772fe8157
msgid "Rudder arming"
msgstr "方向舵解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:188
#: 111dd45cb4b4488ab775de3f190360fa
msgid ""
"If you are using right-rudder + zero-throttle to arm and you don't get a "
"message on your GCS giving a arming failure reason then it may be that your "
"RC calibration is a bit off and the autopilot is not quite seeing zero "
"throttle or isn't quite seeing full right rudder."
msgstr "如果使用右方向舵加零油门解锁时 GCS 没有显示解锁失败原因，可能是 RC 校准偏差导致飞控无法准确识别零油门或满右方向舵。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:194
#: 72d0ed112fb5479584d61a802f80418f
msgid "Reasons for refusing to arm"
msgstr "拒绝解锁的原因"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:196
#: 36d2fad49328490a9f4554be969ee162
msgid ""
"When the autopilot refuses to arm it sends a STATUSTEXT MAVLink message to "
"the GCS explaining why it is refusing. Some possible reasons why the "
"autopilot can refuse to arm are (See the :ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks` "
"topic for more information):"
msgstr ""
"当飞控拒绝解锁时，会向 GCS 发送 STATUSTEXT MAVLink 消息说明原因。以下是飞控可能拒绝解锁的一些原因（更多信息请参阅 "
":ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks` 主题）："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:200
#: 9303e6853bac4d568533e248a0a1a1fb
msgid ""
"**barometer not healthy**. This is very rare. If it happens repeatedly then "
"you may have a barometer hardware fault."
msgstr "**气压计不正常**。这种情况非常罕见。如果反复出现，则可能存在气压计硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:202
#: 2ca60ef580fe42cfb0e559fb084c3d9f
msgid ""
"**airspeed not healthy**. If you have a airspeed sensor fitted and the "
"autopilot is not getting an airspeed reading it will refuse to arm."
msgstr "**空速不正常**。如果安装了空速传感器但飞控未获取到空速读数，将拒绝解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:205
#: 6fc78c4b8fe64143a3a3a5403e45295f
msgid ""
"**logging not available**. If your microSD card has failed or is corrupt "
"then logging won't be available and you cannot arm."
msgstr "**日志记录不可用**。如果 microSD 卡损坏或失效，日志记录将不可用，无法解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:207
#: 66c0e41407b54bb998f4f85bb74684bf
msgid ""
"**gyros not healthy**. If the gyros have failed the autopilot will refuse to"
" arm. This is rare, and if it happens repeatedly then you may have a "
"hardware failure."
msgstr "**陀螺仪不正常**。如果陀螺仪发生故障，飞控将拒绝解锁。这种情况罕见，反复出现可能存在硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:210
#: 7fbedb4b698345108c4f79bad36f8b3b
msgid ""
"**gyros not calibrated**. This happens when the automatic gyro calibration "
"at startup didn't converge. Try rebooting the autopilot with the plane held "
"still."
msgstr "**陀螺仪未校准**。这发生在启动时自动陀螺仪校准未收敛时。请尝试保持飞机静止后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:213
#: a54e6577a8284d5abaf41086a16ad397
msgid ""
"**accels not healthy**. If the accelerometers have failed the autopilot will"
" refuse to arm. Try recalibrating your accelerometers."
msgstr "**加速度计不正常**。如果加速度计发生故障，飞控将拒绝解锁。请尝试重新校准加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:215
#: 3786924b17c94a5dadad22d4ed2b410d
msgid ""
"**GPS accuracy errors**. There are 4 types of GPS arming errors that can be "
"reported. They are \"GPS vert vel error\", \"GPS speed error\", \"GPS horiz "
"error\", \"GPS numsats\". Try moving your plane for better GPS reception or "
"switching off any RF sources (such as a FPV transmitter) that may be "
"interfering with your GPS."
msgstr ""
"**GPS 精度错误**。有 4 种 GPS 解锁错误：「GPS vert vel error」、「GPS speed error」、「GPS "
"horiz error」、「GPS numsats」。请尝试移动飞机以获得更好的 GPS 接收，或关闭可能干扰 GPS 的 RF 源（如图传发射机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:220
#: ce0d60d95ef84532b3e7883319572940
msgid ""
"**Mag yaw error**. This happens when your compass is badly out of alignment."
" Check your compass orientation and re-do your compass calibration or move "
"your plane further away from any magnetic materials."
msgstr "**罗盘偏航误差**。这发生在罗盘严重偏差时。请检查罗盘方向并重新校准罗盘，或将飞机移离任何磁性材料。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:224
#: 9d076145d3c04e19a879b0a160306153
msgid ""
"**EKF warmup**. This happens when the EKF is still warming up. Wait another "
"10 seconds and try again."
msgstr "**EKF 预热**。这发生在 EKF 仍在预热时。请等待 10 秒后再试。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:226
#: 7c93124e215d4d0dad1e7a96c5bdddda
msgid ""
"**AHRS not healthy**. This means the EKF is not healthy. Often this is due "
"to large variations in GPS position and/or velocity reports, even if a solid"
" 3D lock is reported by the GPS and HDOP is low. Be sure your GPS has a "
"clear \"view\" of the sky with no obstructions. If the error persists then "
"try rebooting your board."
msgstr ""
"**AHRS 不正常**。这意味着 EKF 不正常。通常是由于 GPS 位置和/或速度报告存在较大变化，即使 GPS 报告了稳定的 3D 定锁且 "
"HDOP 较低。请确保 GPS 对天空有清晰的「视野」，无遮挡。如果错误持续，请尝试重启主板。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:227
#: c6e1864e43e54c80913df2d71a901380
msgid ""
"**3D accel cal needed**. This happens when you have not done a 3D "
"accelerometer calibration."
msgstr "**需要 3D 加速度计校准**。这发生在尚未进行 3D 加速度计校准时。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:229
#: aa6805de7af3487c8f3716decb8aea37
msgid ""
"**Inconsistent accelerometers**. This happens when you have multiple IMUs "
"(such as the Pixhawk which has two) and they are not consistent. This can be"
" caused by temperature changes. If the error doesn't clear itself after a "
"minute you will need to redo your accelerometer calibration."
msgstr ""
"**加速度计不一致**。这发生在具有多个 IMU（如 Pixhawk "
"有两个）时，它们不一致。可能由温度变化引起。如果错误在一分钟后未自行消除，需要重新校准加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:234
#: e6e5dfa1ab974a308368c29df03763b5
msgid ""
"**Inconsistent gyros**. This happens when you have multiple gyros and they "
"are not reporting consistent values. If the error does not clear itself "
"after 30 seconds then you will need to reboot."
msgstr "**陀螺仪不一致**。这发生在具有多个陀螺仪且它们报告的值不一致时。如果错误在 30 秒后未自行消除，需要重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:237
#: bd5ce28ad2e44b4fa4fe672b055852ca
msgid ""
"**Limit errors**. The arming checks some of your parameter settings to make "
"sure they are in a reasonable range. The checks are \"ROLL_LIMIT_DEG too "
"small\", \"PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG too small\", \"PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG too large\", "
"\"invalid THR_FS_VALUE\"."
msgstr ""
"**限制错误**。解锁检查会检查某些参数设置是否在合理范围内。检查项目为「ROLL_LIMIT_DEG too "
"small」、「PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG too small」、「PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG too large」、「invalid "
"THR_FS_VALUE」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:241
#: 28f0e0cda36b4016bb8985318fa12b81
msgid ""
"**GPS n has not been fully configured**. This happens with a uBlox GPS where"
" the GPS driver is unable to fully configure the GPS for the settings that "
"are being requested. This can be caused by a bad wire between the autopilot "
"and GPS, or by a bad response from the GPS. If the message is about \"GPS "
"0\" then it is the first GPS. If it is \"GPS 1\" then it is the 2nd GPS. If "
"you get a failure for the 2nd GPS and don't have two GPS modules installed "
"then set GPS_TYPE2 to zero to disable the 2nd GPS"
msgstr ""
"**GPS n 未完全配置**。这发生在 uBlox GPS 驱动程序无法按所请求的设置完全配置 GPS 时。可能由飞控与 GPS 之间的线缆不良或 "
"GPS 响应不良引起。如果消息是「GPS 0」，则为第一个 GPS；「GPS 1」则为第二个 GPS。如果第二个 GPS 失败且未安装两个 GPS "
"模块，请将 GPS_TYPE2 设为零以禁用第二个 GPS"
